        {
          "es": "Esta historia viene de viejos libros balineses escritos en hojas de palma secas. Cada libro se llama lontar.",
          "en": "This story comes from old Balinese books written on dried palm leaves. Each book is called a lontar."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno de ellos cuenta cómo los dioses le dieron forma a la isla.",
          "en": "One of them tells how the gods shaped the island."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hoy, los hindúes balineses le rezan a un Dios supremo, llamado Sang Hyang Widhi Wasa.",
          "en": "Today, Balinese Hindus pray to one supreme God, called Sang Hyang Widhi Wasa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dicen que los muchos dioses de las viejas historias son sus distintos rostros.",
          "en": "They say the many gods of the old stories are his different faces."
        }
